@Kumbara.Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health Check
GET {{Kumbara.Gateway_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Identity Service via Gateway
POST {{Kumbara.Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@kumbara.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Wallets via Gateway
GET {{Kumbara.Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/wallets
Accept: application/json

### Ledger via Gateway
GET {{Kumbara.Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ledger/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Transfers via Gateway
GET {{Kumbara.Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/transfers
Accept: application/json

### Risk via Gateway
GET {{Kumbara.Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/risk/health
Accept: application/json
